      "body": "### 项目地址\n\nhttps://github.com/nanobrowser/nanobrowser\n\n### 类别\n\nJS\n\n### 项目标题\n\n开源的浏览器 AI 智能体，帮你自动完成网页任务\n\n### 项目描述\n\nNanobrowser 是一款适用于 Chrome 和 Edge 的开源 AI 浏览器扩展。在侧边栏用自然语言描述任务，它就会自动阅读网页、点击、输入、切换标签页来完成。提交、删除等操作前会先征求你的同意，支持多种云端大模型，也支持 Ollama 等本地模型。\n\n### 亮点\n\n- 免费，使用自己的 API Key。直接在你已登录的真实浏览器中运行，无需额外的无头浏览器。\n- 提供“询问 / 自动”两种模式，可按网站设置“允许 / 询问 / 禁止”，涉及密码和支付的步骤始终交还给你。\n- 可同时运行多个任务，每个任务位于独立的标签组。\n- 支持 Anthropic、OpenAI、Gemini、DeepSeek、OpenRouter 等，也支持本地的 Ollama / LM Studio。\n- 界面支持简体中文和繁体中文。\n- 本项目由维护者自荐。\n\n**English:** Nanobrowser is a Chrome/Edge extension that lets an AI agent do web tasks. Describe a task in the side panel and it reads pages, clicks, types and switches tabs. It asks before submitting or deleting anything, and works with cloud or local models. Free, bring your own key; works in your real logged-in browser; Ask/Auto modes and per-site Allow/Ask/Block rules, with passwords and payments always handed back to you; several tasks at once in separate tab groups. (Submitted by the maintainer.)\n\n### 示例代码\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/nanobrowser/nanobrowser.git\ncd nanobrowser\ncorepack enable\npnpm install\npnpm build      # 构建到 dist/，然后在 chrome://extensions 中加载\n```\n\n### 截图或演示视频\n\n![Nanobrowser 演示](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67622d15-c0c8-420a-9da0-d90934b727b5)\n\n![告诉它你要做什么，它帮你完成](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc774770-aa2f-46eb-9412-27e957827c19)\n\n![你始终掌控：发送前先询问](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c32c5e50-e5f0-4408-80ef-fbeaac5a159d)\n\n![结果整理进表格](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1e9e1fc-3df3-4285-bb7d-01917ef691e1)\n",
